option's engine preview (odds, cost, end band, who takes a miss), each
diver's breath, the opponent read, the drop view and the match framing.
Layout pinned in game/data/ui/reefball_hud.json; strings in
reefball_hud.csv. The controller lets the player choose and the AI play
the other side. Parity, aspect and pseudo-loc tests; shots
reefball_hud_choice and reefball_hud_goal approved.

